? What is multimedia authoring?
+ Integrating assets into a planned title
- Recording every source from scratch
- Compressing a single still image
= Authoring coordinates media, navigation and behaviour.

? What is an authoring metaphor?
+ The system's organising approach
- The final file's storage capacity
- The microphone's input voltage
= A paradigm defines how the author organises the experience.

? Which paradigm uses timed parallel tracks?
+ Timeline-based
- Structure-only
- Flowchart-only
= A timeline shows when media objects start and end.

? Which paradigm uses an icon palette and connected flow line?
+ Flow-control-based
- Pixel-based capture
- Frequency-based capture
= Icons represent operations; links express flow.

? Which approach is closest to traditional programming?
+ Scripting-language-based
- Fixed slide viewing
- Single-frame painting
= Scripts describe conditions, events and actions in code.

? What should a storyboard specify besides visual layout?
+ Timing, media and interaction
- Only the drawing colour
- Only the computer brand
= A production team needs to know what happens and what triggers it.

? What comes after the program idea in the lesson's scripting process?
+ Program brief
- Final distribution
- Archive deletion
= The brief details audience, objectives and outline before further development.

? What is a placed use of a reusable library asset called?
+ An instance
- A new codec
- A sampling rate
= An instance uses a library item in the authored scene.

? What is asset orchestration?
+ Coordinating media according to the story
- Renaming every imported asset identically
- Removing every navigation and event link
= Orchestration controls relationships, timing and presentation.

? Why test the packaged title on a target device?
+ Editor preview may hide delivery problems
- A preview always proves compatibility
- The target device creates the storyboard
= The package must work with actual files, paths and supported formats.

? Which statement correctly describes a VPN?
+ A network access route
- A video compression codec
- An optical disk format
= A VPN affects access and network delivery; it is not a media file format.

? What mainly determines a television delivery specification?
+ The receiving broadcaster's requirements
- The editor's preferred filename
- The number of storyboard colours
= The broadcaster specifies accepted picture, sound and delivery requirements.
